printing.open_print = Londoloza bese uvula i-PDF ukuze uyiphrinte…
printing.invalid = Izilungiselelo zokuphrinta noma ubukhulu besithombe abuvumelekile.
printing.limit = Umsebenzi wokuphrinta weqa umkhawulo: izithombe ezingu-200, amaphikseli ayizigidi ezingu-40 / amaphikseli angu-32768 ohlangothini ngalunye lwesithombe ngasinye, noma u-256 MiB wedatha ye-PDF ecindezelwe.
printing.profile_error = Lesi sithombe sinephrofayela yombala engavumelekile, engahambisani noma engasekelwe. I-CMYK/Lab yemvelo idinga iphrofayela efakiwe evumelekile; i-RGB idinga iphrofayela ye-RGB.
printing.does_not_fit = Isithombe nge-DPI yedokhumenti yaso asingeni kuleli seli. Sebenzisa imodi yokulinganisa, igridi encane noma iphepha elikhulu.
printing.caption_limit = Umbhalo wesithombe mude kakhulu kule gridi. Sebenzisa imigqa noma amakholomu ambalwa, fushanisa umbhalo noma uvale imibhalo yezithombe.
printing.font_error = Ayikho ifonti etholakalayo yombhalo wesithombe. Faka ifonti yombhalo noma uvale imibhalo yezithombe.
printing.no_document = Vula idokhumenti noma ukhethe izithombe kugalari ngaphambi kokuphrinta.
printing.source_error = Isithombe esikhethiwe, ifayela eliseceleni elihleliwe noma umbhalo wesithombe akufundekanga. Ayikho i-PDF elondoloziwe.
printing.save_error = Ayikwazanga ukulondoloza i-PDF. Khetha igama elisha lefayela kufolda evumela ukubhala; amafayela akhona awashintshwa nanini.
printing.downloaded = I-PDF ilandiwe. Yivule kusibukeli se-PDF ukuze uyiphrinte ngo-100%.
